{
  "version": 1,
  "id": "train",
  "name": "Metro car",
  "intro": [
    "The metro car. It stops everywhere and asks nothing. Getting off at the right stop is up to me."
  ],
  "uses": [],
  "readables": [
    {
      "id": "staff",
      "name": "STAFF DOOR",
      "pages": [
        "STAFF ONLY. LOCKED.",
        "NO PASSENGER ACCESS."
      ],
      "promptH": 86
    },
    {
      "id": "ad",
      "name": "NOTICE",
      "pages": [
        "CAMERAS OPERATE IN THIS CAR.",
        "RECORDINGS ARE KEPT FOR THE DURATION OF THE PASSENGER PLUS 90 DAYS."
      ],
      "promptH": 170
    },
    {
      "id": "gangway",
      "name": "TO CAR 2",
      "pages": [
        "CAR 2 · LOCKED.",
        "INTER-CAR TRAVEL SUSPENDED UNTIL FURTHER NOTICE."
      ],
      "promptH": 132
    },
    {
      "id": "suit",
      "name": "MAN IN A SUIT",
      "pages": [
        "I have a meeting at Galleria.",
        "I have had it for six loops now. It keeps getting moved to the next stop."
      ],
      "label": "[E] TALK",
      "promptH": 56
    },
    {
      "id": "courier",
      "name": "COURIER",
      "pages": [
        "Parcel for \"whoever is at the Harbor\". That is the whole address.",
        "I ride round until somebody looks like a whoever."
      ],
      "label": "[E] TALK",
      "promptH": 62
    },
    {
      "id": "elder",
      "name": "OLD WOMAN",
      "pages": [
        "That brake? I pulled it once. Forty years ago. They still send me a letter every birthday.",
        "You have to register an emergency two days ahead now. Nobody plans an emergency.",
        "Well. Some people do."
      ],
      "label": "[E] TALK",
      "promptH": 56
    },
    {
      "id": "punk",
      "name": "PUNK",
      "pages": [
        "They check IDs at every exit now.",
        "So I never get off. Checkmate."
      ],
      "label": "[E] TALK",
      "promptH": 56
    }
  ],
